  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_01",
      "hash": "1a5cdf115cd02093",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：哎呀～！\\n这不是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_02",
      "hash": "1a5ce0115cd02246",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你在这里干什么！？\\c\\n难、难道说[VAR TRNAME(0000)]的宝可梦\\n死掉了吗……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_07",
      "hash": "1a5ce5115cd02ac5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "什么啊……原来不是这样啊！\\n那真是太好了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_03",
      "hash": "1a5ce1115cd023f9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不过我还是帮你看看\\n你的宝可梦的身体状况吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_04",
      "hash": "1a5ce2115cd025ac",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不过我还是帮你看看\\n你的宝可梦们的身体状况吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0510_dummy_01",
      "hash": "82e4e19e96a8c773",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_05",
      "hash": "1a5ce3115cd0275f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊，糟了！\\n光顾着对战，\\r\\n卡拉卡拉不知道跑到哪里去了！\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]知道卡拉卡拉吗？\\n它是种头戴骨头的宝可梦哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_06",
      "hash": "1a5ce4115cd02912",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我看到那只卡拉卡拉\\n似乎是在寻找什么的样子，\\c\\n不知道它是不是\\n去了上面的楼层啊……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p01_cave_d1702",
      "hash": "4bd5a9dd2723f11a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    },
